</svg>		</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-68a4596e elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline" data-id="68a4596e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot;Tsunami Alerts&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200}" data-widget_type="animated-headline.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h3 class="elementor-headline">
					<span class="elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper">Understanding</span>
				<span class="elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper">
					<span class="elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active">Tsunami Alerts</span>
				</span>
				</h3>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-508fc13c elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="508fc13c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Understanding the different tsunami alerts that may be issued is important. See the graphic below for information in English and numerous languages.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7c0a71f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7c0a71f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
